{
  "edges": [
    {
      "fromKey": "n-rga8k8",
      "toKey": "n-v2w4tg",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "The desk entries do not log every field operation (condition), which means the absence of a record for valve manipulation or service change does not prove it did not occur. However, this gap prevents establishing whether an unauthorized action caused the interruption.",
      "status": "unknown",
      "sourceIds": [
        "24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1"
      ],
      "claimIds": [],
      "counterfactual": "If the interruption was caused by an unauthorized valve opening, a field operation record would likely exist if logging were complete. The lack of such a record leaves this branch unresolved.",
      "competingExplanation": "The pressure loss may have originated upstream (source or distribution) rather than from local actions at RHOB.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether the interruption began at the air source, within the distribution system, or at the receiving equipment. No field operation record exists to confirm an unauthorized action occurred during boundary preparation."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-13979pa",
      "toKey": "n-v2w4tg",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "No evidence confirms whether crew U-A/U-B saw recent changes or used a different version of the equipment-location sheet. If they relied on outdated information, this could explain why no temporary instruction was attached despite known service-routing changes.",
      "status": "unknown",
      "sourceIds": [
        "eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1"
      ],
      "claimIds": [],
      "counterfactual": "If the crew had seen recent changes, they would have been expected to attach a temporary instruction or revise their ECP. The absence of such documentation suggests either no change was known or it was missed.",
      "competingExplanation": "The interruption may not be related to configuration drawings but rather an upstream supply failure unrelated to local procedures.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether crew U-A/U-B saw recent changes or used a different version of the equipment-location sheet."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-128uhnw",
      "toKey": "n-v2w4tg",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "No engineering disposition or temporary instruction was attached for changes to instrument-air service affecting RHOB between 2024-03-01 and May 20, 2024. If such a change occurred without documentation, it could explain the lack of awareness among operators.",
      "status": "unknown",
      "sourceIds": [
        "0ff450fe-49da-4c67-8b42-35449fdad35c#1"
      ],
      "claimIds": [],
      "counterfactual": "If a service-routing change occurred without documentation, operators would not have been aware of it. This could lead to unexpected pressure loss during boundary preparation.","competingExplanation":"The interruption may be unrelated to configuration changes and instead caused by an upstream supply failure or equipment malfunction.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether engineering dispositions were issued for instrument-air service changes affecting RHOB between 2024-03-01 and May 20, 2024."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-vay2a6",
      "toKey": "n-v2w4tg",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "When a service-routing change affects an existing maintenance boundary, the affected ECP must be revised or have an approved temporary instruction attached. If this requirement was not met due to missing documentation, it could explain why no protective measures were in place.","status":"unknown","sourceIds":["0ff450fe-49da-4c67-8b42-35449fdad35c#1"],"claimIds":[],"counterfactual":"If a service-routing change occurred without revising the ECP or attaching an approved temporary instruction, operators would not have been aware of potential risks.","competingExplanation":"The interruption may be unrelated to configuration changes and instead caused by an upstream supply failure or equipment malfunction.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether engineering dispositions were issued for instrument-air service changes affecting RHOB between 2024-03-01 and May 20, 2024."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-xb6jf4",
      "toKey": "n-v2w4tg",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale":"No evidence confirms whether U-A/U-B used a different version or saw recent changes. If they relied on outdated information, this could explain why no temporary instruction was attached despite known service-routing changes.","status":"unknown","sourceIds":["eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1"],"claimIds":[],"counterfactual":"If the crew had seen recent changes, they would have been expected to attach a temporary instruction or revise their ECP. The absence of such documentation suggests either no change was known or it was missed.","competingExplanation":"The interruption may not be related to configuration drawings but rather an upstream supply failure unrelated to local procedures.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether crew U-A/U-B saw recent changes or used a different version of the equipment-location sheet."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-1st54eg",
      "toKey": "n-v2w4tg",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale":"No evidence currently establishes whether external factors (third-party work, utility outage) affected the supply. If an upstream event caused the interruption, this would explain why local actions were not responsible.","status":"unknown","sourceIds":[],"claimIds":[],"counterfactual":"If an upstream event occurred without documentation, operators at RHOB would have no way of knowing about it until they experienced its effects.","competingExplanation":"The interruption may be unrelated to external factors and instead caused by a local equipment failure or procedural gap.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether external factors (third-party work, utility outage) affected the supply."
    }
  ],
  "decision": {
    "summary": "The investigation has identified multiple unresolved causal branches related to potential upstream failures, missing documentation of service-routing changes, and possible reliance on outdated information by operators. Each branch remains unsupported due to gaps in evidence regarding whether these conditions actually occurred or contributed to the interruption.","evidenceUsed":["24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1","eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1","0ff450fe-49da-4c67-8b42-35449fdad35c#1"],"unknowns":["Whether the interruption originated upstream, downstream, or within the distribution network.","Whether crew U-A/U-B saw recent changes or used a different version of the equipment-location sheet.","Whether engineering dispositions were issued for instrument-air service changes affecting RHOB between 2024-03-01 and May 20, 2024.","Whether external factors (third-party work, utility outage) affected the supply."],"alternatives":["Upstream failure","Missing documentation of service-routing changes","Reliance on outdated information by operators"],"confidence":0.6},"evidenceRequests":[
    "requestId-1",
    "sourceId:24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1,claimRef:n-xb6jf4"
  ]}
